OL,3,GNEWSAFarmer's giant beach message calls
OL,4,Afor peace
OL,5,
OL,6,FA farmer has used his tractor to write
OL,7,Fa giant message of peace in sand ahead
OL,8,Fof Remembrance Sunday.
OL,10,FJohn Tucker, who has been creating
OL,11,Flarge-scale beach artworks for about 20
OL,12,Fyears, carved the word peace into the
OL,13,Fsand at Bigbury-on-Sea, in Devon.
OL,15,FReflecting on memories of seeing
OL,16,Fsoldiers heading off to serve in the
OL,17,FFalklands War, Tucker said it had been
OL,18,F"very upsetting".
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
