OL,3,GNEWSAFarmer's giant beach message calls
OL,4,Afor peace
OL,5,
OL,6,FSpeaking on his 82nd birthday, he said
OL,7,Fthe motivation behind this year's
OL,8,Fartwork was simple: "We want peace. The
OL,9,Fmost important thing is to have peace."
